th all the power you need to get the job done. A <span style="font-weight: bold;">large load box</span> with a maximum <span style="font-weight: bold;">payload of 1200 kg</span>, and a braked <span style="font-weight: bold;">towing capacity of 2500 kg</span> make it the hard working, dependable team player you've always wanted. <br>All this comes with a contemporary look that includes a restyled signature Mahindra Single Cab 4x4 front grille with chrome inserts, dual projector headlamps, an integrated air-scoop in the bonnet, and tough wrap-around bumpers.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-ad7b" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-dJjagV cQqdEF pf-44_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-kCMLfs khbiTF"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-45_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-46_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-gvZzpm chTUkt pf-47_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmzxHC hSXinz pf-49_">Features</span></h2></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-50_"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-c195" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-dJjagV cQqdEF pf-51_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-kCMLfs khbiTF"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-52_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:20px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:5"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-53_"></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:8;--c-md:8;--c-lg:7"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-54_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-gvZzpm chTUkt pf-55_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmzxHC hSXinz pf-57_">The Ultimate Workhorse</span></h3><p class="sc-bfhwqR jqvVoJ pf-58_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmzxHC hSXinz pf-60_">The versatile single cab bakkie boasts a staggering <span style="font-weight: bold;">1000 kg maximum payload and 2500 kg braked towing capacity</span> with impeccable working credentials. The new Mahindra Pik-Up bakkie loves work, and loves to play!</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-ad2b" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-dJjagV cQqdEF pf-61_"><div class="sc-kCMLfs khbiTF"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-62_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:8;--c-md:8;--c-lg:8"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-63_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-gvZzpm chTUkt pf-64_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmzxHC hSXinz pf-66_">Impressive Interior</span></h3><p class="sc-bfhwqR jqvVoJ pf-67_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-fmzxHC hSXinz pf-69_">Luxurious interiors and loaded with features including the <span style="font-weight: bold;">touch screen infotainment system</span> with <span style="font-weight: bold;">GPS</span> navigation, <span style="font-weight: bold;">Bluetooth</span>, CD/DVD, and with USB/AUX support, the Mahindra Pik-Up responds to your every need. The management system provides vehicle related information at your fingertips while the <span style="font-weight: bold;">automatic temperature control</span> will maintain the cabin just as you like it.</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-70_"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-6bec" data-pf-type="Section" id="penta-pagefly-gallery" class="sc-dJjagV cQqdEF pf-71_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-kCMLfs khbiTF"><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-72_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:20px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bkSTSn hpQOMO pf-73_ penta